<main class="main events-v2" id="events-top">
<div class="events-v2__top-layer" style="padding:1.2rem 0 .2rem;margin:0">
  <section class="section" style="padding:.5rem 0">
    <div class="wrapper events-v2__hero">
      <h1>Gigs, tours &amp; events</h1>
      <p>Here's what we have coming up, plus an abundant (dare I say prolific!) history of where we've been.</p>
